  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "Write a program to check whether a given year is a leap year or not. If a number is divisible by 400400400 or divisible by 444 but not by 100100100, then the year is considered a leap year. Print **Leap year** if the given year is a leap year; otherwise, print **Not a leap year**.",
